    "# 📋 Example 12: Real-World Use Case - Contract Risk Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "**Hook:** *\"Spot red flags in contracts automatically\"*\n",
    "\n",
    "Legal document review is expensive and time-consuming. Fenic can identify risky clauses, extract key terms, and flag unusual conditions in contracts at scale. Perfect for legal teams, procurement departments, or any business dealing with lots of agreements."
