    "        \"subject\": \"Feature request: Dark mode for mobile app\",\n",
    "        \"message\": \"Hi there! I love using your app, especially late at night for work. Would it be possible to add a dark mode option to the mobile version? It would really help reduce eye strain during evening sessions. I know this isn't urgent, just a nice-to-have feature that I think other users would appreciate too. Thanks for considering!\",\n",
